 ## How they connect
 
-The web app keeps sessions in Postgres ([keep sessions in the database](adrs/0001-keep-sessions-in-the-database.md))
-and queues jobs there for the worker. A confirmed pantry order is captured through the card gateway by
-`larder/capture.py`.
+The web app signs and verifies session cookies in [larder/sessions.py](../larder/sessions.py), following the
+[signed-cookie decision](adrs/0001-use-signed-session-cookies.md). It queues jobs in Postgres for the worker.
+A confirmed pantry order is captured through the card gateway by `larder/capture.py`.
